bottomparticipants

title Subsequence - Vote comment 1

actor User
boundary "Comment Section (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control CommentController
control CommentService
entity VoteCommentModel
database MongoDB

CommentService -> VoteCommentModel: 1. findOne(comment_id, user_id)
activate VoteCommentModel
activate CommentService
VoteCommentModel -> MongoDB: 2. query vote
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> VoteCommentModel: 3. existingVote / null
deactivate MongoDB
VoteCommentModel --> CommentService: 4. result
deactivate VoteCommentModel

alt No existing vote
    CommentService -> VoteCommentModel: 4.1.1 create new vote (is_up=false)
    activate VoteCommentModel
    VoteCommentModel -> MongoDB: 4.1.2 insert vote
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> VoteCommentModel: 4.1.3 inserted document
    deactivate MongoDB
    VoteCommentModel --> CommentService: 4.1.4 created vote
    deactivate VoteCommentModel
    CommentService --> CommentController: 4.1.5 Downvoted
    activate CommentController
    CommentController --> Router: 4.1.6 HTTP response
    activate Router
    Router --> UI: 4.1.7 Update vote state
    activate UI
    UI --> User: 4.1.8 See updated downvote
    activate User
else Existing vote is down
    CommentService -> VoteCommentModel: 4.2.1 delete vote
    activate VoteCommentModel
    VoteCommentModel -> MongoDB: 4.2.2 delete document
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> VoteCommentModel: 4.2.3 deletion confirmation
    deactivate MongoDB
    VoteCommentModel --> CommentService: 4.2.4 vote deleted
    deactivate VoteCommentModel
    CommentService --> CommentController: 4.2.5 Downvote removed
    CommentController --> Router: 4.2.6 HTTP response
    Router --> UI: 4.2.7 Update vote state
    UI --> User: 4.2.8 See removed downvote
else Existing vote is up
    CommentService -> VoteCommentModel: 4.3.1 update is_up=false
    activate VoteCommentModel
    VoteCommentModel -> MongoDB: 4.3.2 update document
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> VoteCommentModel: 4.3.3 updated document
    deactivate MongoDB
    VoteCommentModel --> CommentService: 4.3.4 vote updated
    deactivate VoteCommentModel
    CommentService --> CommentController: 4.3.5 Downvoted
    deactivate CommentService
    CommentController --> Router: 4.3.6 HTTP response
    deactivate CommentController
    Router --> UI: 4.3.7 Update vote state
    deactivate Router
    UI --> User: 4.3.8 See updated downvote
    deactivate UI
    deactivate User
end